---
// Shows "Dashboard" in place of Sign in and Sign up to people signed in to
// app.outflare.ai. The app keeps a cookie on outflare.ai while someone is
// signed in, outflare_signed_in=1 (the engine's OUTFLARE_SIGNED_IN_COOKIE_DOMAIN).
// It says only that: the session itself is an HttpOnly cookie that only
// app.outflare.ai gets, and this page never calls the app. Mark elements
// data-signed-out (shown by default, and without scripts) or data-signed-in.
// Runs in <head> so the right links show from the first paint.
---

<script is:inline>
	try { if (/(?:^|;\s*)outflare_signed_in=1(?:;|$)/.test(document.cookie)) document.documentElement.dataset.signedIn = ''; } catch {}
</script>
<style is:global>
	html[data-signed-in] [data-signed-out], html:not([data-signed-in]) [data-signed-in] { display: none !important; }
</style>
